invariant: INV-33
file: webpki.h
catches: pem_files_test
reason: webpki_leaf_info holds the anchor's index in one byte, as it did
  under a cap of twelve anchors, so the index of an anchor past 255 is
  cut to its low byte and the pins read another anchor. No cap bounds the
  count (docs/decisions.md 131). test_full_bundle verifies the r2 chain
  under the last of 300 anchors and requires index 299.

--- old
    size_t anchor_index;
--- new
    uint8_t anchor_index;
